        "created_at": "2013-03-31T15:15:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It would be after the reduction is added. So in a sense Fixer now would negate 1 damages while being able to redirect 2 or 3 damages. Since he would also be redirecting that damage it would no longer be reduced so it'll go back to it's original value to the new target.</p>",
