        "id": 57242,
        "name": "DrScott",
        "username": "DrScott",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-31T15:55:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>OK, so I think I'm starting to get it. &nbsp;Driving Mantis triggers based on the damage that MF would actually take after the Pipe Wrench modifier is applied, but what it redirects is based on the base damage.</p><p><span>This is actually quite a powerful combo in a four character game as a lot of villain, minion and environment damage is \"H-1.\"</span></p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:32:31.068Z",
