        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>OK, so I think I&#39;m starting to get it. &nbsp;Driving Mantis triggers based on the damage that MF would actually take after the Pipe Wrench modifier is applied, but what it redirects is based on the base damage.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">This is actually quite a powerful combo in a four character game as a lot of villain, minion and environment damage is &quot;H-1.&quot;</span></p>",
