      {
        "id": 57246,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-01T19:46:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Personally I see damage reduction as something that is passive thus always in effect. Thus damage is always calculated to how much it will deal before&nbsp;it would actually deal damage, thus getting around the whole in the order of play. Order of play for things like this would just make it overly complicated, which isn't something I would really enjoy. If it would ever appear on a villian that would redirect a &lt;x amount I would do the same thing with them if they also were granted reduction.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
