        "raw": "<p>Personally I see damage reduction as something that is passive thus always in effect. Thus damage is always calculated to how much it will deal before&nbsp;it would actually deal damage, thus getting around the whole in the order of play. Order of play for things like this would just make it overly complicated, which isn&#39;t something I would really enjoy. If it would ever appear on a villian that would redirect a &lt;x amount I would do the same thing with them if they also were granted reduction.</p>",
